TransferCLI
===========

TransferCLI bundles and builds upon transfer.sh:

  transfer.sh
  Copyright (c) 2014-2024 DutchCoders
  Licensed under the MIT License
  https://github.com/dutchcoders/transfer.sh

Since v2.0.0 the transfer.sh binary shipped with TransferCLI is compiled from
unmodified upstream source (the commit pinned in backend/go.mod) with a current
Go toolchain. TransferCLI adds:

- A web admin panel (admin/)
- A small build wrapper for transfer.sh (backend/)
- An installer script (install.sh)
- Systemd unit files
- Example nginx configuration
- Documentation

All TransferCLI-authored code is released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
transfer.sh retains its original MIT license and copyright.
